3. = ἁμάρτημα, **a sinful deed, a sin**: [[40-matthew.12.31|Mat.12:31]], [[44-acts.7.60|Act.7:60]], [[62-1-john.5.16|1Jn.5:16]]. 
_SYN._: see: ἁμάρτημα. (AS)

