(b) **of persons**: [[40-matthew.8.26|Mat.8:26]], al. Metaphorical, of loss of eternal life, [[43-john.3.15|Jhn.3:15-16 10:28 17:12]], [[45-romans.2.12|Rom.2:12]], [[46-1-corinthians.8.11|1Co.8:11 15:18]], [[61-2-peter.3.9|2Pe.3:9]]. In οἱ ἀπολλὺμενοι, the perishing, contrasted in [[46-1-corinthians.1.18|1Co.1:18]], al., with οἱ σωζόμενοι, the "perfective" force of the verb, WH. " implies the completion of the process of destruction," is illustrated (see M, _Pr._, 114 f.; M, _Th._, ii, 2:10); 
