(and Epic ἄχρις, bef. vowel (see MM, see word), [[45-romans.11.25|Rom.11:25]] T, [[48-galatians.3.19|Gal.3:19]] T, WH, mg., [[58-hebrews.3.13|Heb.3:13]]); 
